  "description": "An application submitted under Section 96a of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990 for a non-material amendment in connection with the planning permission dated 20/09/2023 (23/1810/F) for Construction of 8no. 2-storey (plus basement) residential dwellings (Use class C3) with associated external amenity space, refuse/recycling facilities and cycle parking, to allow: Front elevation - Bathroom skylights removed; replaced with standard windows. Rear elevation - Added skylight to roof Rear elevation - Added maintenance access gate to under-croft space. Rear elevation - Changing white render to grey render or introducing grey decorative blocks to the under-croft wall. Rear elevation - Staircase reconfigured. Internal- Basement Floor : Area under bin/ cycle storage added as liveable space to adjacent property (plot no6) Cycle and bins store: Cycle hoops rotated, Rail to flat roof added. Cycle wall racks moved to brick wall from previously proposed screenInternal - basement floor: Additional WC added  to under stair space .",
